ber it forever! Nod! No pressure!","I wanted to ask Astro something and then I just— said nothing? For a while?","Astro is the only one who checks if I'm alright! I'm alright! I'm very alright!"},[v7("\3\138\147\141\8\149\153\129\21\137\153","\195\87\197\220")]={"Pebble! Nope! I don't have any bones for you, buddy!","Fossils are not for pet rocks to chew on! I've said this! Twice!","Pebble buried it. He buried the fossil. We'll talk about this later, Pebble!","I'm telling Dandy! That's— that's a real threat! I'll do it!","Pebble's a rock! A rock with opinions! I respect the opinions!","You're a good rock! But no chewing! That's the rule!",v7("\152\177\170\189\218\107\188\39\190\177\172\166\214\116\188\53\179\254\180\167\149\122\243\39\162\248\173\160\149\125\242\48\241\216\225\160\193\117\240\56\241\246\164\167\149\114\249\38\167\254\180\160\149\125\238\59\164\255\165\243\212\60\236\49\179\243\173\182\148","\84\209\145\193\211\181\28\156"),"Pebble is not interested in the Devonian and that's fine! That's fine!"},[v7("\229\204\1\166\248\226\203\11\164\235\232","\167\177\131\78\232")]={"Wait— that's me! There's another me! Two of us is a fossil conference!","Hello, me! Nice shell! I mean— nice everything!",v7("\129\11\203\83\12\77\28\192\232\12\153\66\68\92\25\202\232\62\131\66\8\68\23\214\232\26\142\7\23\88\2\204\188\77\159\79\1\8\8\196\171\25\152\6\68\109\24\192\166\1\146\6\68\123\30\201\161\25\159\78\10\79\78\195\169\14\159\84\68\65\29\133\190\8\153\94\68\64\15\215\172\76","\165\200\109\235\39\100\40\110"),"I know exactly what I'd say to myself! I'm saying it! Hi!",v7("\190\127\161\59\27\134\111\237\44\83\143\117\243\37\83\136\58\226\36\6\139\59\161\9\30\132\117\239\33\7\140\105\161\39\29\133\99\160\104\62\140\119\227\45\1\154\32\161\61\0\200\58\204\45\22\157\115\239\47\0\211\58\232\37\30\140\126\232\41\7\140\118\248\105","\115\233\26\129\72"),v7("\89\0\216\147\236\125\28\151\134\233\117\1\217\142\240\125\79\151\161\237\118\15\219\139\253\56\29\216\138\225\119\0\21